  "_comment_filters": "A headline alerts if ANY rule accepts it. Within one rule, every field you fill in must pass. AN EMPTY LIST MEANS 'ANY', NEVER 'NONE' - \"tickers\": [] matches every ticker, it does not match nothing.",
  "_comment_terms": "Terms match on token boundaries, never as raw substrings, so 'laba' will not fire on 'kelabakan'. Indonesian affixes need wildcards: 'akuisisi*' (akuisisinya), '*akuisisi' (mengakuisisi), '*akuisisi*' (diakuisisinya). A multi-word term is a phrase and must appear as consecutive words.",
  "_comment_confidence": "min_confidence is the floor for the ticker match itself: 1.00 the ticker in brackets, 0.90 the company name, 0.60 a bare ticker. Raise it for market-wide rules, keep it near 0.5 for your own coverage.",
